+"""Bounded, deterministic native single-file compression; bytes in, bytes out.
+
+One complete gzip, bzip2, XZ or Zstandard stream is accepted. The shared TAR
+decoder supplies strict EOF/trailing-data checks and bounded codec memory.
+No paths, archive members, filesystem access, subprocesses or external codecs.
+"""
